  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Primary Education Support Program-EFA-FTI Catalytic Fund Additional Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed objective of the Additional Financing is to support Djibouti#s second Education Action Plan, namely, to increase equitable access to basic education and improve the quality and effectiveness of the education system.  This objective is the same as the objective of the current EFA-FTI-funded project, the PAEP.</narrative>
  </description>
